<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Baoba: It’s YOU!\nThat musta been a long trip.\rWelcome to the Safari Zone!\nIt ain’t been open long, but it’s\fALREADY the best zoo in Johto.\fAccordin’ to me. I own it.\rMake yourself at home in my safari!\nDon’t touch nothin’ that growls.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Baoba: I’mma keep upgradin’ my safari.\nNew attractions. New merch.\fI’ll hit your Pokégear when I switch\fsomethin’ up. Prob’ly at 3 AM.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Safari Zone...\rIt make me feel like I’m in another\ncountry.\fA weird country. With mud.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">..................\n(I ain’t a talker.)\f(Stop lookin’ at me.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KANGASKHAN: ..................\n(It’s starin’ at your snacks.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This Safari Zone go CRAZY!\rI just kept chasin’ homies!\nMy JIGGLYPUFF got salty though.\fShe don’t like runnin’. Or me.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">JIGGLYPUFF: Puu pupuu.\n(That’s a cuss word.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Safari, safari,\nit’s SO much fun.\rSafari, safari,\nso interestin’, huh!\rSo many homies waitin’ on us!\r...That’s a song I made up.\nI sing it every day. The homies\fhide when they hear it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Zoo Sack go flyin’ under the\nblue sky. Sweat go drippin’ to\fcelebrate a friendship.\rI love the Safari Zone!\r...I made a whole jingle outta it.\nYou think Baoba would buy it?\fHe offered me exposure.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I decided to sell homie drinks.\rI never sold nothin’ before.\nBut how hard can it be?\fThe drinks is mostly tap water.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, you tryna buy somethin’?\nHold up, I’m settin’ up the stand.\rOne sec...\f..................\fI forgot the cups.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">BUTTERFREE: Flu flu.\n(It’s flirtin’ with you.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s MAD homies to pick from,\nbut NOTHIN’ beat how cute SLOWPOKE is.\rPeople always say I look like one!\nI take it as a compliment.\fThey don’t mean it as one.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SLOWPOKE: ...Yawn?\n...\fIt’s already asleep.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I always wanted to catch my first\nhomie at the Safari Zone.\fI been here six hours. Zero homies.\fOne bee sting.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You prob’ly think there’s some\nhigh-tech system for customizin’\fthe Safari Zone, right?\rThe real truth is...\n...it’s me. In a costume. Movin’\fboulders. All night.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Arrrgh...\nI’m SO tired...\fThis job take EVERYTHIN’ outta you...\fBaoba make me move the rocks myself.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Safari Zone\rWhere Everything Is Thrillin’.\nPull up and experience\fthe wild! No refunds!</language>
	</row>
</body>
